  ("Abstract. In self-adjusting computation, programs respond automati-" 0.16315 0.83534 0.309 0.32265 0.32265 0.0122 0.00826 0.2787 0.1009 "CMR9" 0.0136 nil nil 6 "CMBX9" t)
