  ("tion eliminates the dependence between the length of the list and the compu-" 0.09729 0.90173 0.62504 0.6386 0.6386 0.01356 0.00924 0.2381 0.0399 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 12 "CMR10" nil)
  ("tation, making the computation less sensitive to modiciations to the input (e.g." 0.09729 0.90156 0.64323 0.65678 0.65678 0.01356 0.00761 0.2825 0.0671 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 11 "CMR10" nil)
