  ("conquer algorithm to create different splits than before the insertion, ultimately" 0.09729 0.90137 0.67941 0.69296 0.69296 0.01356 0.00705 0.2727 0.0793 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 10 "CMR10" nil)
  ("preventing re-use). Sometimes, such small changes to the algorithm do not suffice" 0.09729 0.90153 0.69759 0.71114 0.71114 0.01356 0.00557 0.3362 0.1065 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 11 "CMR10" nil)
  ("to improve its efficiency and we need to consider an entirely different algorithm." 0.09729 0.9019 0.71559 0.72915 0.72915 0.01356 0.00703 0.2879 0.0206 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 12 "CMR10" nil)
  ("For example, the quicksort algorithm is inherently more sensitive to input mod-" 0.09729 0.9015 0.73377 0.74733 0.74733 0.01356 0.00703 0.3032 0.0339 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 11 "CMR10" nil)
