  ("Continuous/Kinetic: A continuous or kinetic modification affects the rela-" 0.09729 0.9018 0.57413 0.58769 0.58769 0.01356 0.01068 0.2615 0.2379 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 8 "CMBX10" t)
  ("tionship between the input objects but does not affect the set of objects" 0.13664 0.90165 0.59213 0.60569 0.60569 0.01356 0.01053 0.1869 0.0813 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 12 "CMR10" nil)
  ("itself. By a relationship we broadly mean any function mapping objects into" 0.13664 0.90167 0.61031 0.62387 0.62387 0.01356 0.00694 0.3004 0.0548 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 11 "CMR10" nil)
