  ("because the co-domain contains true and false." 0.13664 0.63453 0.6465 0.6604 0.6604 0.01356 0.00756 0.2196 0.0782 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 6 "CMR10" nil)
  ("As an example, consider sorting a list of numbers and how discrete and contin-" 0.09729 0.90169 0.67813 0.69169 0.69169 0.01356 0.00767 0.2708 0.0264 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 13 "CMR10" nil)
