  ("Suppose that we sort a list of numbers, e.g., [30,10,20,0], and then we" 0.12352 0.90157 0.71431 0.72822 0.72822 0.01356 0.01085 0.2142 0.0832 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 12 "CMR10" nil)
  ("insert a new number to the list, e.g. [7,30,10,20,0]. Since the set of objects" 0.09729 0.90171 0.7325 0.7464 0.7464 0.01356 0.00866 0.2361 0.0570 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 13 "CMR10" nil)
  ("itself is modified this is a discrete modification. Note that inserting/deleting" 0.09729 0.90159 0.75068 0.76423 0.76423 0.01356 0.01095 0.2643 0.0483 "CMR10" 0.0151 nil nil 10 "CMR10" nil)
